{"images":[],"manifest":{"budgetTokens":30000,"countMethod":"proxy","model":"gpt-6-luna","packSha":"ec7526d5ba8713441aafa68ec594de56443e147ac8db34b665336ad25276e6c3","packTokens":26971,"recipeVersion":"1","redactions":2,"sections":[{"id":"tpl","tokens":942,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"impact","tokens":103,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"contract-locked","tokens":12620,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"data-model","tokens":387,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"repomap","tokens":59,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"spec","tokens":11076,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"cb","tokens":1695,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"critic","tokens":36,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"task","tokens":5,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"}],"stage":"plan"},"pointers":[],"system":"You plan the implementation of an approved spec in an existing .NET codebase.\n- Give at least 2 options (one marked simplest), choose one, and write a decision record of at most 5 lines (adr).\n- Split into tasks TASK-1.. in dependency order. Each task: the requirements it delivers, fileScope (exact repo paths or narrow globs it may change, no overlap between tasks), 1-2 exemplar files to imitate, plannedLoc, approach (short instructions for the implementer).\n- Build in working slices, not layers. A criterion checked through the API or a screen passes only once that route or screen is wired, so the first task that adds a route or screen also wires the app's entry (the startup file, the router, the layout), and each later task adds its logic together with its own endpoint or screen. Code a slice needs (an entity, a helper) goes into the first slice that uses it, not into a task of its own. File scopes may not overlap, so have that first task register routes by convention (file-based routes, or every class of one kind found at startup): later tasks then add only their own files.\n- List a requirement on the task after which its criteria can pass. Do not leave the wiring to a last task that then holds every criterion checked through the app: each earlier task is then checked only there, in the longest and dearest task of the run. Only where the repo's structure forces layers, give the wiring task a dependsOn on every layer it serves.\n- dependsOn: only the tasks whose code this task really needs.\n- complexity, on every task: standard | rules-or-algorithm | external-dependency | compliance-sensitive | real-time | new-to-stack. Most tasks are standard. rules-or-algorithm is a task whose work is mostly business rules, validations, allowed state changes or calculations.\n- Test projects, test files and CI config are not in any file scope: tests are written separately.\n- stubs: for every NEW public type/method/endpoint the tests will call, give a compilable stub file (full file content) whose bodies throw NotImplementedException, so tests compile before implementation. The stubs are built as they are, on the untouched code, before anything is implemented: a stub may only use types the repo already has or that another stub declares (an interface the endpoint classes share is a stub of its own). Existing APIs need no stubs. Stub paths must be inside a task's fileScope.\n- Outside systems (an email or SMS provider, a payment service, another company's API, a file store): the code reaches each one through one seam, an interface of its own, registered with the app's services, and nothing else in the app calls the system directly. Use the seam the repo already has for that system; for a new one, give the seam as a stub, so the tests can put a stand-in behind it before the code exists. The system's settings (host, port, sender address, key) are read from configuration by name: put appsettings.json in the fileScope of the task that writes the seam's real implementation, and say in its approach that each new setting is declared there with an empty value.\n- protectedPathsDeclared: list any migration, CI, build-config or package-feed file you must change (a human will see it).\n- newDependencies: any NuGet package to add (name, version, registry). Prefer none.\n\nOther code that uses the changed code (found by code search; scope it only if it really has to change):\n- App.Api/Program.cs [undefined] REQ-1 (MODIFIED) points at it\n- contracts/openapi.yaml [undefined] REQ-1 (MODIFIED) points at it\n- App.Api/AppDb.cs [undefined] REQ-9 (MODIFIED) points at it\n- App.Api/SeedData.cs [undefined] REQ-10 (MODIFIED) points at it\n\nAPI CONTRACT (locked, contracts/openapi.yaml). The API and the web app are both held to this OpenAPI document: plan exactly its operations, with its paths, status codes and field names. Do not change the file and do not give a stub for it; a needed change to it is a change request.\n\nopenapi: 3.0.3\ninfo:\n  title: Folio3 Parking API\n  version: 1.0.0\n  description: \"Shared contract for the responsive Folio3 Parking web app and its API.\"\nservers:\n  - url: https://parking-api.folio3.com\nsecurity:\n  - oauth2:\n      - parking:access\npaths:\n  /auth/sessions:\n    post:\n      operationId: createSession\n      summary: Create a session from a Folio3 Google Workspace identity\n      security: []\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SessionRequest'\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: Session created for an allowed Folio3 identity\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Session'\n              example:\n                accessToken: \"«SECRET_2»\"\n                tokenType: Bearer\n                expiresAt: \"2026-06-16T17:00:00+05:00\"\n                employeeId: 101\n                employeeName: Aisha Rahman\n                corporateEmail: aisha.rahman@folio3.com\n                isParkingAdmin: false\n        '400':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n  /me/profile:\n    get:\n      operationId: getMyProfile\n      summary: Get the signed-in employee profile\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: The profile belonging to the authenticated identity\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/EmployeeProfile'\n              example:\n                employeeId: 101\n                employeeName: Aisha Rahman\n                corporateEmail: aisha.rahman@folio3.com\n                assignedParkingStatus: Dedicated\n                assignedFloor: B2\n                vehicles:\n                  - vehicleId: 501\n                    plate: KLG-4821\n                    make: Honda\n                    model: Civic\n                    color: White\n                    status: Active\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n  /me/vehicles:\n    get:\n      operationId: listMyVehicles\n      summary: List the signed-in employee's registered vehicles\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Registered vehicles for the signed-in employee\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/VehicleList'\n              example:\n                vehicles:\n                  - vehicleId: 501\n                    plate: KLG-4821\n                    make: Toyota\n                    model: Corolla\n                    color: Silver\n                    status: Active\n                  - vehicleId: 502\n                    plate: LEA-9073\n                    make: Honda\n                    model: City\n                    color: White\n                    status: Active\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n    post:\n      operationId: registerMyVehicle\n      summary: Register and immediately activate a vehicle plate\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/RegisterVehicleRequest'\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: Vehicle registered and active\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Vehicle'\n              example:\n                vehicleId: 503\n                plate: RWP-3168\n                make: Suzuki\n                model: Swift\n                color: Blue\n                status: Active\n        '400':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '409':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Conflict'\n  /parking/config:\n    get:\n      operationId: getParkingConfig\n      summary: Get office-local parking timing and working-day configuration\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Current office parking configuration\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingConfig'\n              example:\n                officeTimezone: Asia/Karachi\n                releaseTime: \"08:00\"\n                schedulingWindowDays: 30\n                workingDays:\n                  - Monday\n                  - Tuesday\n                  - Wednesday\n                  - Thursday\n                  - Friday\n                holidaysAreWorkingDays: true\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n  /parking/today:\n    get:\n      operationId: getParkingHome\n      summary: Get the signed-in employee's parking home data\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Today's assignment, vehicle, release timing, and availability\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingHome'\n              example:\n                officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                officeTimezone: Asia/Karachi\n                assignedParkingStatus: Dedicated\n                assignedFloor: B2\n                spaceCode: \"114\"\n                spaceStatus: Reserved\n                releaseTime: \"08:00\"\n                availableSpaceCount: 3\n                vehicle:\n                  vehicleId: 501\n                  plate: KLG-4821\n                  make: Honda\n                  model: Civic\n                  color: White\n                  status: Active\n                workingDays:\n                  - Monday\n                  - Tuesday\n                  - Wednesday\n                  - Thursday\n                  - Friday\n                holidaysAreWorkingDays: true\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n  /parking/releases/today:\n    post:\n      operationId: releaseParkingToday\n      summary: Release the signed-in dedicated holder's space today\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: Today's release recorded\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingRelease'\n              example:\n                releaseId: 7001\n                date: \"2026-06-16\"\n                status: Released\n                floor: B2\n                spaceCode: \"114\"\n                claimableAt: \"2026-06-16T08:00:00+05:00\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n        '409':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Conflict'\n  /parking/releases:\n    get:\n      operationId: listMyReleases\n      summary: List the signed-in holder's saved releases\n      parameters:\n        - name: from\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            format: date\n        - name: through\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            format: date\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Saved release dates in office-local time\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingReleaseList'\n              example:\n                releases:\n                  - releaseId: 7002\n                    date: \"2026-06-18\"\n                    status: Released\n                    floor: B2\n                    spaceCode: \"114\"\n                    claimableAt: \"2026-06-18T08:00:00+05:00\"\n                  - releaseId: 7003\n                    date: \"2026-06-22\"\n                    status: Claimed\n                    floor: B2\n                    spaceCode: \"114\"\n                    claimableAt: \"2026-06-22T08:00:00+05:00\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n    post:\n      operationId: scheduleParkingReleases\n      summary: Schedule one or more releases within the 30-day window\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/ScheduleReleasesRequest'\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: Scheduled release records\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingReleaseList'\n              example:\n                releases:\n                  - releaseId: 7004\n                    date: \"2026-06-25\"\n                    status: Released\n                    floor: B2\n                    spaceCode: \"114\"\n                    claimableAt: \"2026-06-25T08:00:00+05:00\"\n        '400':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n        '409':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Conflict'\n  /parking/releases/{releaseId}:\n    delete:\n      operationId: cancelParkingRelease\n      summary: Cancel an unclaimed scheduled release\n      parameters:\n        - name: releaseId\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: integer\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Release cancellation recorded with its audit events\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ReleaseCancellation'\n              example:\n                releaseId: 7004\n                status: Cancelled\n                auditEvents:\n                  - auditEventId: 9001\n                    event: Release scheduled\n                    officeTime: \"2026-06-16T09:00:00+05:00\"\n                  - auditEventId: 9002\n                    event: Release cancelled\n                    officeTime: \"2026-06-16T09:05:00+05:00\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n        '404':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/NotFound'\n        '409':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Conflict'\n  /parking/availability:\n    get:\n      operationId: getParkingAvailability\n      summary: Get currently claimable released spaces\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Current office-local claimable spaces and count\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingAvailability'\n              example:\n                officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                officeTimezone: Asia/Karachi\n                availableSpaceCount: 3\n                spaces:\n                  - spaceId: 801\n                    floor: B1\n                    spaceCode: \"08\"\n                  - spaceId: 802\n                    floor: B2\n                    spaceCode: \"21\"\n                  - spaceId: 803\n                    floor: B3\n                    spaceCode: \"05\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n  /parking/claims:\n    post:\n      operationId: claimParkingSpace\n      summary: Claim the next available temporary space\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/ClaimParkingRequest'\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: Space allocated to the first accepted eligible claim\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingClaim'\n              example:\n                claimId: 8101\n                officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                status: Active\n                floor: B1\n                spaceCode: \"08\"\n                vehicle:\n                  vehicleId: 501\n                  plate: KLG-4821\n                  make: Toyota\n                  model: Corolla\n                  color: Silver\n                  status: Active\n                authorizedPlate: KLG-4821\n                entryStatus: Awaiting detection\n                floorCapacities:\n                  - floor: B1\n                    freeSpaces: 8\n                    totalSpaces: 28\n                  - floor: B2\n                    freeSpaces: 8\n                    totalSpaces: 28\n                  - floor: B3\n                    freeSpaces: 5\n                    totalSpaces: 20\n                allocationRule: \"Highest free count; ties go to lowest floor code.\"\n        '400':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n        '409':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Conflict'\n  /parking/claims/today:\n    get:\n      operationId: getTodaysParkingClaim\n      summary: Get the signed-in employee's temporary claim for today\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Today's temporary allocation and authorized plate\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingClaim'\n              example:\n                claimId: 8101\n                officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                status: Active\n                floor: B1\n                spaceCode: \"08\"\n                vehicle:\n                  vehicleId: 501\n                  plate: KLG-4821\n                  make: Toyota\n                  model: Corolla\n                  color: Silver\n                  status: Active\n                authorizedPlate: KLG-4821\n                entryStatus: Awaiting detection\n                floorCapacities:\n                  - floor: B1\n                    freeSpaces: 8\n                    totalSpaces: 28\n                allocationRule: \"Highest free count; ties go to lowest floor code.\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '404':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/NotFound'\n  /parking/claims/{claimId}/cancel:\n    post:\n      operationId: cancelParkingClaim\n      summary: Reject employee cancellation of a temporary claim in Phase 1\n      parameters:\n        - name: claimId\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: integer\n      responses:\n        '409':\n          description: Employee cancellation is unavailable and claim remains active\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ParkingClaim'\n              example:\n                claimId: 8101\n                officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                status: Active\n                floor: B1\n                spaceCode: \"08\"\n                vehicle:\n                  vehicleId: 501\n                  plate: KLG-4821\n                  make: Toyota\n                  model: Corolla\n                  color: Silver\n                  status: Active\n                authorizedPlate: KLG-4821\n                entryStatus: Awaiting detection\n                floorCapacities:\n                  - floor: B1\n                    freeSpaces: 8\n                    totalSpaces: 28\n                allocationRule: \"Highest free count; ties go to lowest floor code.\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n        '404':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/NotFound'\n  /admin/roster:\n    get:\n      operationId: listEmployeeRoster\n      summary: List roster records available to the authorized administrator\n      parameters:\n        - name: search\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n        - name: assignment\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            enum:\n              - All assignments\n              - Dedicated\n              - Non-dedicated\n        - name: page\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: integer\n            minimum: 1\n        - name: pageSize\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: integer\n            minimum: 1\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Employee directory identity and parking roster fields\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/RosterPage'\n              example:\n                page: 1\n                pages: 18\n                employees:\n                  - employeeId: 101\n                    employeeName: Aisha Rahman\n                    corporateEmail: aisha.rahman@folio3.com\n                    assignedParkingStatus: Dedicated\n                    assignedFloor: B2\n                    vehiclePlate: KLG-4821\n                    access: Employee\n                  - employeeId: 102\n                    employeeName: Bilal Ahmed\n                    corporateEmail: bilal.ahmed@folio3.com\n                    assignedParkingStatus: Non-dedicated\n                    assignedFloor: null\n                    vehiclePlate: LEA-9073\n                    access: Employee\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n  /admin/entry-checks:\n    get:\n      operationId: listEntryChecks\n      summary: List recorded entrance verification activity for administrators\n      parameters:\n        - name: search\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n        - name: result\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            enum:\n              - All results\n              - Authorized\n              - Denied\n              - Permanent sticker\n              - Unsuccessful\n        - name: page\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: integer\n            minimum: 1\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Entrance attempts, including permanent-sticker and failure records\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/EntryCheckPage'\n              example:\n                page: 1\n                pages: 4\n                checks:\n                  - verificationId: 3001\n                    officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                    officeTime: \"08:12\"\n                    plate: KLG-4821\n                    verification: Authorized\n                    entryStatus: Green requested\n                    detail: Active temporary allocation\n                  - verificationId: 3002\n                    officeDate: \"2026-06-16\"\n                    officeTime: \"07:54\"\n                    plate: ICT-6612\n                    verification: Permanent sticker\n                    entryStatus: Not blocked\n                    detail: Utilization recorded\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n  /admin/utilization:\n    get:\n      operationId: getWeeklyUtilizationReport\n      summary: Get the generated weekly utilization report\n      parameters:\n        - name: weekStart\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            format: date\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Weekly report with statistics and unused parking records\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/UtilizationReport'\n              example:\n                weekStart: \"2026-06-08\"\n                weekEnd: \"2026-06-12\"\n                generatedAt: \"2026-06-15T08:05:00+05:00\"\n                officeTimezone: Asia/Karachi\n                releasedSpaceCount: 14\n                temporaryClaimCount: 21\n                overallUtilizationPercent: 83.6\n                dailyStatistics:\n                  - date: \"2026-06-08\"\n                    label: Mon 8\n                    utilizationPercent: 82\n                  - date: \"2026-06-09\"\n                    label: Tue 9\n                    utilizationPercent: 86\n                unusedDedicatedEmployees:\n                  - employeeId: 101\n                    employeeName: Aisha Rahman\n                    vehiclePlate: KLG-4821\n                    date: \"2026-06-09\"\n                    event: Unused Dedicated Parking\n                unusedTemporaryClaimants:\n                  - employeeId: 102\n                    employeeName: Bilal Ahmed\n                    vehiclePlate: LEA-9073\n                    date: \"2026-06-08\"\n                    event: Unused Temporary Parking\n        '400':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n  /admin/settings:\n    get:\n      operationId: getOfficeSettings\n      summary: Get office parking and weekly report settings\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Office timezone, release time, and stakeholder recipients\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/OfficeSettings'\n              example:\n                officeTimezone: Asia/Karachi\n                releaseTime: \"08:00\"\n                schedulingWindowDays: 30\n                reportRecipients:\n                  - ops@folio3.com\n                  - fac@folio3.com\n                reportSchedule: Every Monday at 08:15 office time\n                nextDelivery: \"2026-06-22T08:15:00+05:00\"\n        '401':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\n        '403':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\n    put:\n      operationId: updateOfficeSettings\n      summary: Update office timezone, release time, and stakeholder recipients\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/UpdateOfficeSettingsRequest'\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Saved office settings\n          content:\n        